 at the time and place and in the form required by the contract. If the seller has handed over documents before that time, he may, up to that time, cure any lack of conformity in the documents, if the exercise of this right does not cause the buyer unreasonable inconve- CONVENTION ON CONTRACTS FOR THE INTERNATIONAL SALE OF GOODS"